In the course of the (few) really successful games I've
played, I've noticed a tendency for my bags of holding to
get cursed.  I mean, much more than my other inventory. 
Is there some selection process that favors bags of holding
over other items for cursing?  It's certainly a good way
to cripple me.

I saw somebody on another thread suggesting that one 
carry a blessed bag of holding and holy water to keep it
that way, but I deal with it differently.  In my experience,
items inside bags don't get cursed.  I just put my BoH
(there, I use the abbreviation, happy?) in a normal bag
or an oilskin sack, if it's available, and it doesn't get
cursed.  It's inconvenient, but so is getting all your
inventory nuked by the amulet.

Well, whatever.

